    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Tax Retrieval API provides a seamless way to access the tax information associated with items in a user's ecommerce shopping cart. This API serves as a crucial resource for applications that require up-to-date tax calculations based on current cart contents. Typical consumers include online retailers and e-commerce platforms that need to display accurate tax amounts during the checkout process. By retrieving the tax data, businesses can enhance user experience and ensure compliance with local tax regulations.",
